# Milestone: M6 wave 1
# Origin: legacy tests/2.x/slot-cow-const.chk
# Covers: class declaration + .new() + COW write to derived overrides
#         a slot inherited from the parent class.
#
# The legacy fixture marks the parent slot `const` to verify constness
# does not interfere with copy-on-write.  v1.0 has no `const var` parse
# sugar; the underlying COW semantics are identical for non-const slots
# (T8/T9/T10 from M4), so we exercise the same write-on-derived /
# parent-unchanged path with an unmarked slot.  The const-keyword flavor
# defers to v1.x with the parse sugar.

class a { var x = 0 }; var b = a.new(); b.x = 12
[00000000] 12

a.x
[00000001] 0
